      ],
      "notes": [
        "This FIR is a repository-visible Listbox widget progression slice beyond the current public reference runtime closure.",
        "The Listbox diagram value is numeric, matching the selected item value from the .frog item records.",
        "The selected item id remains a UI identity member used to resolve the display label and host interaction state.",
        "Viewport members such as item_offset/top row are widget-instance display state; they do not derive into the diagram value and do not flow from control to indicator.",
        "An indicator may locally reveal a newly published selected value when its own .frog instance enables viewport.auto_reveal_selected_value.",
        "The Default Listbox SVG realization publishes item_region, item_row, item_icon, item_label, active_item, selection_face, hover_face, disabled_face, scrollbars, caption, label, and focus_ring parts.",
        "Interactive hosts may update Listbox front-panel selection state without executing the diagram; Execute runs the manifest-backed identity proof.",
        "Runtime implementation for this example continues in Graiphic/FROG-Runtime unless explicitly promoted later."
      ]
    }
  ]
